WEBVTT

00:11:58.088 --> 00:12:03.469
still find ourselves
being exclusive and expensive,

00:12:03.469 --> 00:12:06.638
keeping students
on the wrong side of that wall.

00:12:08.682 --> 00:12:13.353
Instead of thousands
of autonomous universities,

00:12:13.395 --> 00:12:15.731
this is what I would like to see happen.

00:12:16.398 --> 00:12:20.152
I would like to see universities,
companies and governments

00:12:20.194 --> 00:12:24.865
invest deeply in a higher
education superhighway

00:12:24.907 --> 00:12:28.869
that allows for the fluidity
and the transferability of experiences

00:12:28.911 --> 00:12:30.871
from place to place,